checked-2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord},\\omega\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord},\\omega\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^\\alpha\">\\(\\omega^\\alpha\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5c52eb8a9d5ba532\" href=\"?note=5c52eb8a9d5ba532\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-exponentiation\">18-df-ordinal-exponentiation</a> 的指数类函数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Epsilon}\">\\(\\mathrm{Epsilon}\\)</span> 是下式定义的可定义类，非集合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Epsilon}\\coloneqq\\{\\varepsilon\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\omega^\\varepsilon=\\varepsilon\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Epsilon}\\coloneqq\\{\\varepsilon\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\omega^\\varepsilon=\\varepsilon\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §3.3.1 研究 ω 幂固定点及 ε 数；保留原笔记 Epsilon 类接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-exponentiation","status":"resolved","id":"5c52eb8a9d5ba532","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]",